        <mxCell id="note1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E4F6F8;strokeColor=#9BD9E2;fontColor=#24515A;fontSize=12;align=left;spacing=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;What makes this Pull from Source 1?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Enterprise operates source CDC/publication tracking plus an explicit subscription resume/recovery service. Vendor remains responsible for committing its safe delivery position and synchronizing its target. Enterprise does not guess or advance vendor progress." vertex="1">
